{"synopsis":"Ryu Gang-min adalah anggota Batala, sebuah organisasi pembunuh bayaran besar.\n\nBegitu memasuki tempat ini, tidak ada jalan keluar.\n\n\n\nKemudian suatu hari, ia menerima tugas khusus sebagai imbalan atas kebebasannya.\n\nPermintaan tersebut adalah untuk membunuh target di Korea.\n\n\n\nDemi kebebasannya, Ryu Gang-min kembali ke Korea. Sebagai pemanasan, ia terlebih dahulu melenyapkan seorang pengkhianat dari organisasi tersebut.\n\n\n\nSetelah menyelesaikan pemanasan ringannya, ia akhirnya memulai misi sebenarnya…","alternative_title":"청부입학","author":"Jiddung","artist":"YLAB","chapters":[{"number":"15","chapter":"15","slug":"ch_15","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"14","chapter":"14","slug":"ch_14","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"13","chapter":"13","slug":"ch_13","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-03"},{"chapter_id":"1347fd20-6f51-4793-816f-b77742827172","number":"12","chapter":"12","title":"","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e6f3b404-6613-49d1-9116-00a210d4f3b7/chapter_ch_12/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e6f3b404-6613-49d1-9116-00a210d4f3b7/chapter_ch_12/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e6f3b404-6613-49d1-9116-00a210d4f3b7/chapter_ch_12/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e6f3b404-6613-49d1-9116-00a210d4f3b7/chapter_ch_12/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e6f3b404-6613-49d1-9116-00a210d4f3b7/chapter_ch_12/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e6f3b404-6613-49d1-9116-00a210d4f3b7/chapter_ch_12/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e6f3b404-6613-49d1-9116-00a210d4f3b7/chapter_ch_12/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e6f3b404-6613-49d1-9116-00a210d4f3b7/chapter_ch_12/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e6f3b404-6613-49d1-9116-00a210d4f3b7/chapter_ch_12/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e6f3b404-